# @@name@@

An HTTP service with one route, `GET /health`, which answers `{"status":"ok"}`. Every other request answers 404.

## Build

```
gradle build
```

Gradle and a JDK 21 are needed. The project has no Gradle wrapper. Run `gradle wrapper` once if you want one.

## Test

```
@@test_command@@
```

## Run

```
gradle run
```

The service listens on the port in the `PORT` environment variable and on 8080 when it is not set.
